OL,4,G0306FOutlook
OL,5,     GWhen Tanya Tagaq received a
OL,6,     Gcassette from her mum to ease her
OL,7,     Ghomesickness, she rediscovered a
OL,8,     Gsuppressed Inuit tradition, made
OL,9,     Git her own, and caught a global
OL,10,     Gstar's attention.
OL,11,G0350FWitness History
OL,12,     GIn 2004, Danish food entrepreneur
OL,13,     GClaus Meyer launched the 'Nordic
OL,14,     GKitchen Manifesto', kick-starting
OL,15,     Ga revolution in Nordic cooking
OL,16,     Gfocused on local seasonal
OL,17,     Gingredients.
